@prefix dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .

<http://example.org/sen0414-ch1617corr-lineage> a owl:Ontology ;
    rdfs:label "Fresh narrow lineage: SEN0414 Chapters 11, 17 and 16 corrections"@en ;
    owl:versionInfo "1.37.0" ; owl:versionIRI <http://example.org/sen0414-ch1617corr-lineage/1.37.0> ; owl:priorVersion <http://example.org/sen0414-ch1617corr-lineage/1.36.0> ; dcterms:identifier "sen0414_ch1617corr_lineage" ;
    rdfs:comment """1.37.0 (2026-11-25): Chapter 17 release story done: check logs saved and the three-role review record written (08-tooling/ch17-deck/logs_v4_0_0/REVIEW_RECORD_ch17_v1_0_0.md). Chapter 17 is complete in this lineage; chapter 16 follows."""@en .

ex:TK10_Release_17_Build backlog:hasState backlog:Done ;
    backlog:hasAuditNote "Done 2026-11-25. Review record written: four conditions times three roles, labelled agent-made and not independent. One verdict is Partly met (dense code slides 18, 25, 26, 28 on a small screen). One open owner point: the portraits on slides 6 and 40 against the ruling on photos of public figures (pictures carried from the approved earlier decks, unchanged)." .
ex:TK10_Release_17_Verify backlog:hasState backlog:Done ;
    backlog:hasAuditNote "Done 2026-11-25. The saved logs were read: standard, fit, layout, overlap, notes, reader notes, story prose, manifest self-check, analogy word search (0 hits) all clean or pass; story repeat lists 2 older pairs outside chapter 17 (ch3/ch2, ch14/ch2). Not done: code check C1 to C5 (no line-list source), a look at the page in a browser, a re-opening of story links." .
ex:ST10_Release_17 backlog:hasState backlog:Done ;
    backlog:hasAuditNote "Done 2026-11-25; the acceptance criterion holds (logs saved, review record with a verdict per condition and role). The limits named in the two tasks stand." .
